# TinaCloud (production admin + hosted content API)
# Create a project at https://app.tina.io and connect this GitHub repo.
# Client ID: project Overview. Read-only token: Tokens tab.
# Use these with `npm run build:tina` (or set in Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables).

NEXT_PUBLIC_TINA_CLIENT_ID=
TINA_TOKEN=

# Optional: force Tina branch for tinacms build (must match Tina Cloud → Branches), e.g. if CI branch env is missing
# TINA_BRANCH=main
